									2/27/2005 12:00:00 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><font size="4"><strong>Grummus</strong></font><br />It was nice to see so many show up for Grummus, especially at the last minute like that!&nbsp; We need a little more practice, it was our first attempt afterall.&nbsp; Even though we didn't quite get him, I'm still very proud of everyone!</p>
								</div>
