								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="left"><font color="#7fffd4"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We need to do something fun coming up&nbsp;soon.&nbsp; I'm thinking next Sunday night.&nbsp; Send me some ideas hehe.&nbsp; Naked fishing is always good!&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In any case, for those who aren't aware...We are allied with Lycans of Legend and Hunters of the Dragon.&nbsp; I just thought I should make sure I said something about that.&nbsp; Both guilds are great about sending whoever they can to help out, and they rock!</strong></font></p>&nbsp; <p align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/Amy.jpg" /></p>
